{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 53,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.79139709472656,
        27.289522171020508,
        328.7294006347656,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "6. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS FOR TREATMENT OF PNEUMONIA",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.082763671875,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "in 70 (18%; 15 of whom also had recurrent wheezing). Agreement between the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.09283447265625,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "paediatricians’ and the paediatric chest physicians’ diagnoses was high (κ=0.86, 95%",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        120.51290893554688,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "CI 0.82 to 0.90).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.0914611816406,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Overall, WHO criteria had a sensitivity of 84% and a specificity of 19% in predicting",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.1427917480469,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia. Adding fever to the WHO criteria slightly reduced the sensitivity to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.0428161621094,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "81%, but improved specificity to 46%. In children with wheeze, WHO criteria had",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.1329040527344,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "a sensitivity of 90% and a specificity of 12% for predicting pneumonia. The addition",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.12286376953125,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "of fever reduced the sensitivity to 85%, but improved specificity to 42%. The ability",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.1228332519531,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "of WHO criteria to predict pneumonia was much better in children without wheeze",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.032958984375,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "(sensitivity 76% and specificity 62%). The addition of fever to the criteria had no effect",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        277.472900390625,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "on the sensitivity and improved the specificity to 70%.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.071533203125,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "[Mathews et al 2009] conducted a prospective cohort study in a paediatric",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.0628967285156,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "emergency department in the USA to determine the clinical predictors of pneumonia",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        399.0528869628906,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "among children with wheeze. Children (<18 years) with wheeze on examination, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        241.7421112060547,
        399.0928955078125,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "who underwent a chest X-ray for evaluation of pneumonia were enrolled. Pneumonia",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        254.7421112060547,
        399.1228942871094,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "was defined radiographically, and required the consensus of two blinded radiologists.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        267.7420959472656,
        399.1513977050781,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "The study included 526 patients; 75% were less than 5 years old. A total of 26 patients",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        280.7420959472656,
        399.09295654296875,
        294.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "had pneumonia. Eighty-one percent of patients with pneumonia had a history of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        293.7420959472656,
        399.0628356933594,
        307.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "fever at home, compared with 58% of patients with no pneumonia (positive LR: 1.39,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        306.7420959472656,
        399.11285400390625,
        320.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "95% CI: 1.13–1.70); p < 0.02). Fifty percent of patients with pneumonia had a triage",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.7420959472656,
        399.0928649902344,
        333.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "temperature of < 38.0 °C, compared with only 25% of patients without pneumonia",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        332.7420959472656,
        399.0928649902344,
        346.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "(positive LR: 2.03, 95% CI: 1.34–3.07; p < 0.01). Seventy-three percent of patients with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        345.7420959472656,
        399.1128234863281,
        359.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia had a temperature of < 38.0°C in the emergency department, compared",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        358.7420959472656,
        396.8227233886719,
        372.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "with 38% of patients who did not have pneumonia (positive LR: 1.92, 95% CI: 1.48–",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        371.7420959472656,
        399.11285400390625,
        385.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "2.49; p < 0.001). Among afebrile children (temperature of < 38 °C) with wheezing,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        384.7420959472656,
        288.0329284667969,
        398.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia was very uncommon (2.2%, 95% CI: 1.0–4.7).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        409.2607116699219,
        163.96286010742188,
        421.2507019042969
      ],
      "text": "6.1.2\t Benefits and risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        424.9054260253906,
        88.77290344238281,
        437.04541015625
      ],
      "text": "Benefits",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        437.9154052734375,
        399.0828857421875,
        451.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "Rationalizing antibiotic therapy avoids the risk of side effects for the patient, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        450.9154052734375,
        234.89288330078125,
        464.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "reduces the risk of antimicrobial resistance.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        472.4093017578125,
        78.65290069580078,
        484.5492858886719
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        485.4192810058594,
        324.27288818359375,
        498.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Withholding antibiotics from children with bacterial pneumonia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        509.9378967285156,
        207.80299377441406,
        521.9279174804688
      ],
      "text": "6.1.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        525.5924682617188,
        399.1028747558594,
        539.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "Withholding antibiotics may be less acceptable to caregivers. Implementation of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        538.5924682617188,
        399.0829772949219,
        552.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "this recommendation will require training health workers to educate and council",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        551.5924682617188,
        399.1027526855469,
        565.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "caregivers, and the need for close follow-up. Health workers will require training in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        564.5924682617188,
        111.18289184570312,
        578.0824584960938
      ],
      "text": "auscultation.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.4268035888672,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.61680603027344,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "39",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}